{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Avoid re-offloading failures that will not be checkpointed.** This path runs for virtual, replay-children, and early-completion children, yet `rebindForwardedError` still loads and writes through the child offloader. It can orphan payloads or turn an otherwise local/ignored branch failure into an invocation-level storage failure. Resolve forwarded data only for local normalization without target offloading, and add virtual and late-child failure tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ogouD","finding_digest":"6033ab2d1de854574579cb25d1b1f3d1684258ac3c46127de1e9e8f01bbbacbe","finding_id":"arf_v1_maz2wli55bkforlzzms5dmpt2f","finding_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::handlechildcontextfailure::nonpersistent-forwarded-error-offload","identity_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::handlechildcontextfailure::nonpersistent-forwarded-error-offload","line":222,"observation_digest":"015bb5dff1390e3888935739ef32fda5b135a1c09c431e56420a9f55d9fba8cf","observation_id":"aro_v1_afn3lx7rhehdrcetk4466mx5uw","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/ChildContextOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T04:50:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_luzevhemfv6mrdhhrsgok54yrc","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"c874591dded0506dcae17ee102c93e2ac243ed69","reviewer":"codex","start_line":220,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_5qejvxnmy3jl26eqj4g7o3z4nh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T04:50:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
